    <description>JPS 07 Nov 2025 - Make sure that it works in standalone location or to a child location [AT-59]
JPS 16 Oct 2025 - Optimize flow to resolve SOQL limit error [AT-58]
JPS 6 Oct 2025 - For a Stock Transfer, in the purchase order transfer wizard, set the Account to Adept Turnkey. Set Location from Account in stock transfer if &quot;Use this Account for Stock Transfer&quot; is checked. [AT-50]
WM 17 July - bug fixes
WM 7 July - set Stock Transfer record type, process parent first</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaToday</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>Today()</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaUnitCost</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>NULLVALUE({!Loop_Location_Products.nao__Product__r.nao__Weighted_Average_Cost__c}, 0)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>functionCalculateResidualAmount</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!unResolvedStockQuantity} - {!Loop_Location_Products.nao__Available_To_Promise__c}</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
